* ''Item 7's house calls'' (S3 to S6, talk-story, 2026-11-05). The swarm holders start through a ward act; a seat's reach to the unix socket gets assumed until `S4` measures it; the co-signing device fresh-unlocks too; set-aside devices count toward the device total and never co-sign; with no capability descriptor the relay refuses at start and writes nothing; the receipt trust root names the daemon's vessel key as a residual; the house cap and lane shares sync fleet-wide on the face-private board, while go, roster and receipts stay device-local. The design rests in <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/seat-harness#/the-swarm-slices`>>.

